,\x20la\x20pausa\x20y\x20el\x20joystick,\x20que\x20ahora\x20también\x20puede\x20ser\x20fijo\x20en\x20vez\x20de\x20aparecer\x20donde\x20pones\x20el\x20dedo.','Mobile:\x20you\x20can\x20now\x20place\x20the\x20buttons\x20wherever\x20you\x20want.\x20In\x20Settings\x20>\x20Controls\x20>\x20Place\x20the\x20buttons,\x20drag\x20the\x20attacks\x20(with\x20the\x20item),\x20the\x20pause\x20button\x20and\x20the\x20joystick,\x20which\x20can\x20now\x20also\x20be\x20fixed\x20instead\x20of\x20appearing\x20where\x20you\x20put\x20your\x20finger.']],'chg':[['Las\x20tablas\x20de\x20la\x20semana\x20y\x20del\x20mes\x20del\x20ranking\x20empiezan\x20de\x20cero,\x20como\x20el\x20histórico:\x20ahora\x20sólo\x20cuentan\x20partidas\x20con\x20la\x20Sentencia\x20de\x20Arceus\x20y\x20todas\x20las\x20tablas\x20cuadran\x20entre\x20sí.','The\x20weekly\x20and\x20monthly\x20leaderboards\x20start\x20from\x20scratch,\x20like\x20the\x20all-time\x20one:\x20now\x20only\x20runs\x20with\x20the\x20Judgment\x20of\x20Arceus\x20count,\x20and\x20all\x20boards\x20match\x20each\x20other.'],[_0x4945b9(0x243),'Important:\x20the\x20only\x20official\x20PokéSurvivor\x20website\x20is\x20pokesurvivor.com.\x20The\x20game\x20is\x20and\x20always\x20will\x20be\x20free:\x20if\x20any\x20other\x20website\x20asks\x20you\x20to\x20pay\x20(for\x20tickets,\x20coins\x20or\x20anything\x20else),\x20it\x20isn’t\x20us.\x20You\x20will\x20also\x20see\x20this\x20when\x20signing\x20in\x20and\x20in\x20the\x20Legal\x20notice.'],['El\x20código\x20del\x20juego\x20pasa\x20a\x20una\x20licencia\x20no\x20comercial\x20(PolyForm\x20Noncommercial\x201.0.0):\x20se\x20puede\x20seguir\x20estudiando\x20y\x20modificando,\x20pero\x20nadie\x20puede\x20cobrar\x20por\x20él.',_0x4945b9(0x3f0)]],'fix':[['Cooperativo:\x20la\x20partida\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20queda\x20parada\x20con\x20cada\x20uno\x20esperando\x20a\x20que\x20el\x20otro\x20elija.\x20Un\x20objeto\x20y\x20las\x20cartas\x20de\x20nivel\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20tapan,\x20y\x20si\x20la\x20conexión\x20pierde\x20un\x20aviso\x20se\x20arregla\x20solo.','Co-op:\x20the\x20game\x20no\x20longer\x20freezes\x20with\x20each\x20player\x20waiting\x20for\x20the\x20other\x20to\x20choose.\x20An\x20item\x20and\x20the\x20level-up\x20cards\x20no\x20longer\x20cover\x20each\x20other,\x20and\x20if\x20the\x20connection\x20drops\x20a\x20message\x20it\x20fixes\x20itself.'],[_0x4945b9(0x601),'Co-op:\x20after\x20coming\x20back\x20from\x20a\x20rift,\x20players\x20who\x20are\x20not\x20the\x20host\x20can\x20see\x20every\x20enemy\x20again\x20(some\x20used\x20to\x20be\x20invisible,\x20with\x20only\x20their\x20attacks\x20showing).'],['Amigos:\x20si\x20tu\x20móvil\x20u\x20ordenador\x20tiene\x20la\x20hora\x20(o\x20la\x20zona\x20horaria)\x20mal\x20puesta,\x20tus\x20amigos\x20ya\x20no\x20salen\x20siempre\x20desconectados\x20y\x20sus\x20invitaciones\x20te\x20llegan.','Friends:\x20if\x20your\x20phone\x20or\x20computer\x20has\x20the\x20wrong\x20time\x20(or\x20time\x20zone),\x20your\x20friends\x20no\x20longer\x20always\x20show\x20as\x20offline\x20and\x20their\x20invitations\x20reach\x20you.'],['Los\x20avisos\x20grandes\x20de\x20la\x20partida\x20(un\x20Gholdengo\x20cerca,\x20una\x20marea...)\x20ya\x20salen\x20siempre\x20centrados.','Big\x20in-game\x20announcements\x20(a\x20nearby\x20Gholdengo,\x20a\x20swarm...)\x20are\x20always\x20centered\x20now.']]},{'d':_0x4945b9(0x485),'title':['La\x20Sentencia\x20de\x20Arceus','The\x20Judgment\x20of\x20Arceus'],'new':[['La\x20Sentencia\x20de\x20Arceus:\x20al\x20llegar\x20al\x20minuto\x2030,\x20Arceus\x20baja\x20del\x20cielo\x20y\x20te\x20lleva\x20a\x20las\x20Ruinas\x20del\x20Juicio.\x20Es\x20invencible,\x20te\x20persigue\x20cada\x20vez\x20más\x20deprisa\x20y\x20lanza\x20pilares\x20de\x20luz,\x20rayos\x20y\x20ondas;\x20si\x20te\x20toca,\x20te\x20quita\x20casi\x20media\x20vida.\x20Cada\x205\x20segundos\x20acude\x20un\x20legendario\x20con\x20el\x20doble\x20de\x20vida\x20y\x20de\x20daño\x20que\x20el\x20anterior.\x20¿Cuánto\x20aguantarás?','The\x20Judgment\x20of\x20Arceus:\x20at\x20minute\x2030,\x20Arceus\x20descends\x20from\x20the\x20sky\x20and\x20takes\x20you\x20to\x20the\x20Ruins\x20of\x20Judgment.\x20It\x20is\x20invincible,\x20chases\x20you\x20faster\x20and\x20faster\x20and\x20casts\x20pillars\x20of\x20light,\x20beams\x20and\x20shockwaves;\x20if\x20it\x20touches\x20you,\x20you\x20lose\x20almost\x20half\x20your\x20HP.\x20Every\x205\x20seconds\x20a\x20legendary\x20joins,\x20each\x20with\x20twice\x20the\x20HP\x20and\x20damage\x20of\x20the\x20previous\x20one.\x20How\x20long\x20can\x20you\x20last?'],['Tres\x20logros\x20nuevos:\x20La\x20Sentencia\x20(llega\x20al\x20minuto\x2030),\x20Ante\x20el\x20Creador\x20(aguanta\x201\x20minuto\x20ante\x20Arceus)\x20y\x20Desafío\x20divino\x20(derrota\x20a\x203\x20legendarios\x20ante\x20Arceus\x20en\x20una\x20partida).','Three\x20new\x20achievements:\x20The\x20Judgment\x20(reach\x20minute\x2030),\x20Before\x20the\x20Creator\x20(survive\x201\x20minute\x20against\x20Arceus)\x20and\x20Divine\x20challenge\x20(defeat\x203\x20legendaries\x20against\x20Arceus\x20in\x20a\x20single\x20run).'],['Música\x20nueva\x20para\x20la\x20pelea\x20contra\x20Arceus.','New\x20music\x20for\x20the\x20fight\x20against\x20Arceus.'],[_0x4945b9(0x499),'A\x20button\x20to\x20report\x20suspicious\x20records\x20on\x20the\x20leaderboard\x20(the\x20little\x20flag\x20on\x20each\x20row).']],'chg':[['El\x20ranking\x20histórico\x20empieza\x20de\x20cero:\x20ahora\x20que\x20las\x20partidas\x20acaban\x20ante\x20Arceus,\x20las\x20marcas\x20de\x20antes\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20podrían\x20alcanzar.\x20Las\x20tablas\x20de\x20hoy,\x20de\x20la\x20semana\x20y\x20del\x20mes\x20siguen\x20igual.','The\x20all-time\x20leaderboard\x20starts\x20from\x20scratch:\x20now\x20that\x20runs\x20end\x20against\x20Arceus,\x20older\x20records\x20could\x20no\x20longer\x20be\x20reached.\x20The\x20daily,\x20weekly\x20and\x20monthly\x20boards\x20are\x20unchanged.'],['Se\x20quita\x20el\x20tiempo\x20extra\x20del\x20minuto\x2060\x20(ya\x20no\x20se\x20llega\x20hasta\x20ahí).','Overtime\x20from\x20minute\x2060\x20is\x20removed\x20(runs\x20no\x20longer\x20get\x20that\x20far).'],['Desde\x20el\x20minuto\x2028\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20abren\x20grietas,\x20para\x20que\x20la\x20Sentencia\x20no\x20te\x20pille\x20dentro\x20de\x20una.','Rifts\x20no\x20longer\x20open\x20from\x20minute\x2028\x20on,\x20so\x20the\x20Judgment\x20does\x20not\x20catch\x20you\x20inside\x20one.'],[_0x4945b9(0x2e6),'Leaderboard\x20protected\x20against\x20cheating:\x20the\x20server\x20checks\x20that\x20every\x20record\x20was\x20really\x20played.\x20You\x20never\x20lose\x20anything\x20you\x20earn\x20by\x20playing.'],[_0x4945b9(0x1d9),'Records\x20over\x2035\x20minutes\x20have\x20been\x20removed\x20from\x20the\x20leaderboard:\x20with\x20the\x20Judgment\x20of\x20Arceus\x20they\x20are\x20no\x20longer\x20possible.']],'fix':[['Las\x20tiradas\x20del\x20gacha,\x20los\x20Pokémon\x20nuevos\x20y\x20los\x20premios\x20se\x20guardan\x20en\x20la\x20nube\x20al\x20momento.\x20Si\x20abriste\x20el\x20juego\x20en\x20otro\x20aparato\x20o\x20navegador\x20y\x20te\x20faltaba\x20algo,\x20vuelve\x20a\x20abrirlo\x20donde\x20lo\x20conseguiste:\x20se\x20recupera\x20solo.','Gacha\x20pulls,\x20new\x20Pokémon\x20and\x20rewards\x20are\x20saved\x20to\x20the\x20cloud\x20right\x20away.\x20If\x20you\x20opened\x20the\x20game\x20on\x20another\x20device\x20or\x20browser\x20and\x20something\x20was\x20missing,\x20open\x20it\x20again\x20where\x20you\x20got\x20it:\x20it\x20comes\x20back\x20on\x20its\x20own.']]},{'d':'2026-10-12','title':['Tiempo\x20extra\x20y\x20grietas\x20con\x20menos\x20azar',_0x4945b9(0x595)],'new':[['Tiempo\x20extra:\x20desde\x20el\x20minuto\x2060\x20los\x20Pokémon\x20salvajes\x20se\x20vuelven\x20cada\x20vez\x20más\x20fuertes\x20(más\x20vida\x20y\x20más\x20daño),\x20y\x20cada\x20vez\x20más\x20deprisa.\x20Antes,\x20con\x20las\x20mejoras\x20al\x20máximo,\x20algunas\x20partidas\x20no\x20acababan\x20nunca;\x20ahora\x20las\x20mejores\x20rondarán\x20la\x20hora\x20y\x20media.','Overtime:\x20from\x20minute\x2060\x20on,\x20wild\x20Pokémon\x20keep\x20getting\x20stronger\x20(more\x20HP\x20and\x20more\x20damage),\x20faster\x20and\x20faster.\x20Before,\x20with\x20maxed\x20upgrades,\x20some\x20runs\x20never\x20ended;\x20now\x20the\x20best\x20ones\x20will\x20last\x20about\x20an\x20hour\x20and\x20a\x20half.'],['El\x20juego\x20se\x20actualiza\x20solo\x20cuando\x20sale\x20una\x20versión\x20nueva:\x20si\x20estás\x20en\x20el\x20menú,\x20a\x20los\x205\x20segundos;\x20si\x20estás\x20jugando,\x20al\x20acabar\x20la\x20partida\x20(sin\x20perder\x20nada).','The\x20game\x20now\x20updates\x20itself\x20when\x20a\x20new\x20version\x20is\x20out:\x20within\x205\x20seconds\x20if\x20you\x20are\x20in\x20the\x20menu,\x20or\x20after\x20your\x20run\x20if\x20you\x20are\x20playing\x20(without\x20losing\x20anything).'],['Botón\x20de\x20Novedades\x20(esta\x20ventana)\x20con\x20todos\x20los\x20cambios\x20del\x20juego.','A\x20\x22What\x27s\x20new\x22\x20button\x20(this\x20window)\x20with\x20every\x20change\x20to\x20the\x20game.'],['Números\x20más\x20fáciles\x20de\x20leer:\x20el\x202,\x20el\x205\x20y\x20el\x208\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20confunden.','Easier\x20to\x20read\x20numbers:\x202,\x205\x20and\x208\x20no\x20longer\x20look\x20alike.'],['Elige\x20la\x20versión\x20normal\x20o\x20shiny\x20de\x20tu\x20compañero\x20desde\x20el\x20menú\x20principal,\x20debajo\x20de\x20él.','Pick\x20the\x20normal\x20or\x20shiny\x20version\x20of\x20your\x20partner\x20right\x20from\x20the\x20main\x20menu,\x20under\x20it.'],[_0x4945b9(0x475),'New\x20upgrades\x20for\x20each\x20Pokémon:\x20Critical\x20Hit\x20(+3%\x20critical\x20chance\x20per\x20level,\x20crits\x20deal\x20x1.5\x20damage),\x20Card\x20reroll\x20(+1\x20level-up\x20card\x20reroll\x20per\x20run)\x20and\x20Ban\x20(block\x20moves\x20so\x20they\x20never\x20show\x20up\x20in\x20your\x20cards;\x20pick\x20them\x20in\x20Upgrades).'],['Atajos\x20de\x20movimientos\x20(en\x20Mejoras,\x20para\x20cada\x20Pokémon):\x20elige\x20qué\x20movimiento\x20va\x20siempre\x20en\x20cada\x20hueco,\x20por\x20ejemplo\x20Confusión\x20siempre\x20en\x20el\x201,\x20para\x20la\x20memoria\x20muscular.','Move\x20shortcuts\x20(in\x20Upgrades,\x20for\x20each\x20Pokémon):\x20choose\x20which\x20move\x20always\x20goes\x20in\x20each\x20slot,\x20for\x20example\x20Confusion\x20always\x20on\x201,\x20for\x20muscle\x20memory.']],'chg':[['Avalancha\x20hace\x20menos\x20daño\x20(21\x20en\x20vez\x20de\x2026):\x20derrotaba\x20casi\x20el\x20doble\x20que\x20la\x20media\x20de\x20los\x20movimientos.','Rock\x20Slide\x20deals\x20less\x20damage\x20(21\x20instead\x20of\x2026):\x20it\x20defeated\x20almost\x20twice\x20as\x20many\x20as\x20the\x20average\x20move.'],['Los\x20cambios\x20de\x20cartas\x20de\x20nivel\x20ya\x20no\x20se\x20ganan\x20venciendo\x20jefes:\x20tienes\x201\x20gratis\x20por\x20run\x20y\x20el\x20resto\x20se\x20compra\x20en\x20Mejoras.','Level-up\x20card\x20rerolls\x20are\x20no\x20longer\x20earned\x20by\x20defeating\x20bosses:\x20you\x20get\x201\x20free\x20per\x20run\x20and\x20can\x20buy\x20more\x20in\x20Upgrades.'],['Los\x20legendarios\x20de\x20grieta\x20ya\x20no\x20dan\x20siempre\x20tickets\x20x10:\x20dan\x20uno\x20la\x20mitad\x20de\x20las\x20veces\x20(antes\x20daban\x202\x20siempre\x20y\x20salían\x20demasiados).','Rift\x20legendaries\x20no\x20longer\x20always\x20drop\x20x10\x20tickets:\x20they\x20drop\x20one\x20half\x20of\x20the\x20time\x20(they\x20used\x20to\x20always\x20drop\x202,\x20which\x20was\x20too\x20many).'],['Cooperativo:\x20si\x20vuestras\x20redes\x20no\x20consiguen\x20conectar\x20entre\x20sí,\x20la\x20sala\x20lo\x20avisa\x20y\x20lo\x20reintenta\x20sola,\x20en\x20vez\x20de\x20jugar\x20a\x20tirones\x20por\x20un\x20servidor\x20lento.','Co-op:\x20if\x20your\x20networks\x20cannot\x20connect\x20to\x20each\x20other,\x20the\x20room\x20says\x20so\x20and\x20keeps\x20retrying,\x20instead\x20of\x20playing\x20laggy\x20through\x20a\x20slow\x20server.'],['Hemos\x20cambiado\x20de\x20servidores\x20para\x20que\x20el\x20juego\x20siga\x20siendo\x20gratis:\x20puede\x20que\x20tengas\x20que\x20volver\x20a\x20iniciar\x20sesión\x20(con\x20la\x20misma\x20cuenta\x20y\x20contraseña,\x20o\x20con\x20Google).\x20Tu\x20partida\x20y\x20tus\x20Pokémon\x20siguen\x20igual.','We\x20moved\x20to\x20new\x20servers\x20so\x20the\x20game\x20can\x20stay\x20free:\x20you\x20may\x20need\x20to\x20sign\x20in\x20again\x20(with\x20the\x20same\x20account\x20and\x20password,\x20or\x20with\x20Google).\x20Your\x20save\x20and\x20your\x20Pokémon\x20are\x20unchanged.'],['Gacha:\x20los\x20shiny\x20ya\x20no\x20salen\x20repetidos.\x20Si\x20te\x20toca\x20uno\x20que\x20ya\x20tienes,\x20sale\x20otro\x20de\x20la\x20misma\x20rareza\x20que\x20te\x20falte.','Gacha:\x20shinies\x20no\x20longer\x20come\x20out\x20as\x20duplicates.\x20If\x20you\x20roll\x20one\x20you\x20already\x20have,\x20you\x20get\x20another\x20of\x20the\x20same\x20rarity\x20that\x20you\x20are\x20missing.'],['Grietas\x20con\x20menos\x20azar:\x20cada\x20vez\x20que\x20no\x20sale\x20una,\x20la\x20siguiente\x20es\x20más\x20probable\x20(como\x20mucho\x202,5\x20minutos\x20sin\x20grieta).','Less\x20random\x20rifts:\x20every\x20time\x20one\x20does\x20not\x20show\x20up,\x20the\x20next\x20one\x20is\x20more\x20likely\x20(at\x20most\x202.5\x20minutes\x20without\x20a\x20rift).'],['Los\x20legendarios\x20que\x20aún\x20no\x20has\x20vencido\x20salen\x204\x20veces\x20más\x20en\x20las\x20grietas.','Legendaries\x20you\x20have\x20not\x20beaten\x20yet\x20show\x20up\x204\x20times\x20as\x20often\x20in\x20rifts.'],['Los\x20curanderos\x20curan\x20más\x20cuanto\x20más\x20fuerte\x20pegas,\x20pero\x20cada\x20vez\x20menos\x20y\x20con\x20un\x20tope\x20(como\x20mucho\x20el\x202,5x).','Healers\x20heal\x20more\x20the\x20harder\x20you\x20hit,\x20but\x20with\x20diminishing\x20returns\x20and\x20a\x20cap\x20(2.5x\x20at\x20most).'],['Ataques\x20cuerpo\x20a\x20cuerpo\x20más\x20fuertes:\x20mientras\x20llevas\x20uno\x20activo\x20recibes\x20un\x2025\x20%\x20menos\x20de\x20daño,\x20llegan\x20un\x2025\x20%\x20más\x20lejos\x20y\x20hacen\x20un\x2020\x20%\x20más\x20de\x20daño.','Stronger\x20melee\x20attacks:\x20while\x20one\x20is\x20active\x20you\x20take\x2025%\x20less\x20damage,\x20and\x20they\x20reach\x2025%\x20further\x20and\x20deal\x2020%\x20more\x20damage.'],['Cooperativo:\x20al\x20elegir\x20con\x20qué\x20objeto\x20quedarte,\x20la\x20partida\x20se\x20para\x20para\x20todos\x20(antes\x20seguía\x20y\x20te\x20pegaban\x20mientras\x20elegías).','Co-op:\x20choosing\x20which\x20held\x20item\x20to\x20keep\x20now\x20pauses\x20the\x20run\x20for\x20everyone\x20(it\x20used\x20to\x20keep\x20going\x20and\x20you\x20got\x20hit\x20while\x20choosing).'],[_0x4945b9(0x1ab),'Co-op:\x20while\x20someone\x20is\x20choosing\x20a\x20fusion,\x20the\x20run\x20pauses\x20for\x20everyone.'],['Cooperativo:\x20si\x20el\x20anfitrión\x20cambia\x20de\x20pestaña\x20o\x20se\x20le\x20para\x20el\x20juego,\x20la\x20partida\x20se\x20pausa\x20para\x20todos\x20hasta\x20que\x20vuelva.','Co-op:\x20if\x20the\x20host\x20switches\x20tabs\x20or\x20their\x20game\x20stalls,\x20the\x20run\x20pauses\x20for\x20everyone\x20until\x20they\x20are\x20back.'],[_0x4945b9(0x46e),'Runs\x20shorter\x20than\x201\x20minute\x20no\x20longer\x20count\x20for\x20the\x20leaderboard.']],'fix':[['Quitadas\x20del\x20ranking\x20las\x20marcas\x20rotas\x20por\x20el\x20fallo\x20del\x20minuto\x2084\x20(el\x20reloj\x20seguía\x20corriendo\x20con\x20el\x20juego\x20parado)\x20y\x20alguna\x20imposible.\x20Si\x20tenías\x20una,\x20tu\x20próxima\x20partida\x20vuelve\x20a\x20contar.',_0x4945b9(0x590)],['iPhone\x20(Safari\x20y\x20Chrome):\x20a\x20veces\x20no\x20se\x20podía\x20cambiar\x20de\x20movimiento\x20tocando\x20los\x20iconos,\x20sobre\x20todo\x20con\x20el\x20otro\x20dedo\x20en\x20el\x20joystick.\x20Además\x20los\x20botones\x20quedan\x20por\x20encima\x20de\x20la\x20barra\x20de\x20inicio.','iPhone\x20(Safari\x20and\x20Chrome):\x20sometimes\x20you\x20could\x20not\x20switch\x20moves\x20by\x20tapping\x20the\x20icons,\x20especially\x20with\x20your\x20other\x20finger\x20on\x20the\x20joystick.\x20Buttons\x20also\x20sit\x20above\x20the\x20home\x20bar\x20now.'],['En\x20las\x20partidas\x20de\x20más\x20de\x2084\x20minutos\x20la\x20pantalla\x20se\x20quedaba\x20en\x20negro,\x20el\x20juego\x20se\x20paraba\x20o\x20empezabas\x20a\x20subir\x20de\x20nivel\x20sin\x20fin.\x20Ya\x20puedes\x20jugar\x20todo\x20lo\x20que\x20aguantes.','In\x20runs\x20longer\x20than\x2084\x20minutes\x20the\x20screen\x20went\x20black,\x20the\x20game\x20froze\x20or\x20you\x20kept\x20levelling\x20up\x20forever.\x20Now\x20you\x20can\x20play\x20for\x20as\x20long\x20as\x20you\x20survive.'],['Si\x20el\x20juego\x20fallara,\x20la\x20partida\x20se\x20cierra\x20sola\x20y\x20se\x20guarda\x20(tiempo,\x20derrotados,\x20récords\x20y\x20ranking)\x20en\x20vez\x20de\x20perderse.','If\x20the\x20game\x20ever\x20crashes,\x20the\x20run\x20ends\x20by\x20itself\x20and\x20is\x20saved\x20(time,\x20defeated,\x20records\x20and\x20leaderboard)\x20instead\x20of\x20being\x20lost.'],['Las\x20partidas\x20muy\x20largas\x20a\x20veces\x20se\x20tomaban\x20por\x20trampas\x20y\x20no\x20contaban\x20para\x20el\x20ranking.','Very\x20long\x20runs\x20were\x20sometimes\x20flagged\x20as\x20cheating\x20and\x20did\x20not\x20count\x20for\x20the\x20leaderboard.'],['Cooperativo:\x20si\x20el\x20anfitrión\x20cambiaba\x20de\x20pestaña,\x20los\x20enemigos\x20se\x20quedaban\x20quietos\x20y\x20los\x20demás\x20jugaban\x20con\x20ventaja.','Co-op:\x20if\x20the\x20host\x20switched\x20tabs,\x20enemies\x20stood\x20still\x20and\x20everyone\x20else\x20got\x20a\x20free\x20advantage.'],['iPhone:\x20mantener\x20el\x20dedo\x20en\x20el\x20joystick\x20sacaba\x20\x22Copiar\x20/\x20Seleccionar\x20todo\x22.','iPhone:\x20holding\x20your\x20finger\x20on\x20the\x20joystick\x20brought\x20up\x20\x22Copy\x20/\x20Select\x20all\x22.'],[_0x4945b9(0x394),_0x4945b9(0x3e3)]]},{'d':'2026-10-11','title':['Vínculos','Bonds'],'new':[['Vínculos:\x20al\x20vencer\x20a\x20un\x20legendario\x20fusionas\x20movimientos\x20que\x20se\x20lanzan\x20a\x20la\x20vez\x20desde\x20un\x20solo\x20hueco\x20(hasta\x204).','Bonds:\x20defeating\x2